{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Dad","text":"Coward. Dad wait for braver fighter.","uri":"472b603a356371646b0f376dd4707788.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Dad","text":"No human pass through arena without defeating Dad!","uri":"dbe0574ab558245a1ea966a97ac793c6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Dad","text":"Stop! You win. Not hurt Dad.","uri":"bdce057607d8fbf4d9195cb97781e298.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Dad","text":"Tiny human brave. Dad squish!","uri":"c5e83eb7848349ea1bbe6b628351e91e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Dad","text":"Troll named after first thing try to eat!","uri":"45d565fdcdf4737c3d5115fd880f33f6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Dad","text":"What tiny human do in troll arena? Dad challenge human to fight!","uri":"a24227b5e0bac3066d94258c53409a0a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"...and?","uri":"ae58e5b71cd0a204535fdea217b19bac.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"God speed friend! I would send some of my men with you, but none of them are brave enough to follow.","uri":"3059d11e033bf79015c5eda561dcc71e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"How are you getting on with rescuing Godric?","uri":"c8318f4c78c5b738216dacf8544d29a2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"Hurry, friend! Who knows what they'll do with Godric?","uri":"c2f7418933cfe6f9cc6adfa076e44efe.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"Hurry, friend. Find a way to free Godric!","uri":"49574c27d2bccbf8369695319fefea28.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"I'm afraid I have bad news. We made our attack as planned, but we met unexpected resistance.","uri":"fad8feda92ae3469a007512c9230d898.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"Oh, what great news! You should hurry to tell Dunstan, he will be overjoyed!","uri":"f847e760619d474062fb21f023bd757e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"The way to the stronghold is treacherous, friend. Even if you manage to climb your way up, there will be many trolls defending the stronghold.","uri":"719a0f1561f85316d31f62109b951167.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"We were ambushed by trolls coming from the north. They captured Dunstan's son, Godric, who we enlisted at your request; we tried to follow but we were repelled at the foot of their stronghold.","uri":"324718071d7edf1580bbc879babb54d2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Denulth","text":"Welcome back friend!","uri":"c45532cce114b34e6729831a54998ec5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Dunstan","text":"He is safe and sound, thanks to you my friend!","uri":"77fc36303768df94c4273282e406ca48.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Dunstan","text":"I have very little to offer you in way of thanks, but perhaps you will accept this family heirloom. It was found by my great-great-grandfather, but we still don't have any idea what it does.","uri":"2bdcf233f614931199596fcea36d3077.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Eadgar","text":"Thanks! I'm off back home!","uri":"61f6e54c0b5df59e1536ca194dbc881a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Troll Stronghold","character":"Godric","text":"Thank you, my friend.","uri":"73833aa7ae1c48a7a2bf88de25ce4d5b.mp3"}
